OL,3,GNEWSANew trains arrive on the DLR -
OL,4,Aafter severe delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first of 54 new trains for the
OL,7,FDocklands Light Railway (DLR) are being
OL,8,Fintroduced to London's transport
OL,9,Fnetwork after a two-year delay.
OL,11,FThe new DLR fleet was due to arrive in
OL,12,FApril 2024, but its arrival was delayed
OL,13,Funtil October 2025.
OL,15,FThe trains, which have live travel
OL,16,Finformation, air conditioning and
OL,17,Fmobile charging points, were then
OL,18,Frecalled within a month after a safety
OL,19,Fissue was discovered, and are now
OL,20,Ffinally being reintroduced.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
