OL,3,GNEWSANew trains arrive on the DLR -
OL,4,Aafter severe delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FStuart Harvey, TfL's chief capital
OL,7,Fofficer, said: "I apologise for the
OL,8,Fdelay in reintroducing the trains but
OL,9,Fam pleased this marks an important
OL,10,Fmilestone in delivering a modern new
OL,11,Ffleet for the DLR."
